      "_": "Keyed by the cell holding the FLAG ICON, which is the square you must enclose. The numbered badge hangs one cell below on a pole and is a label, not a target -- the 18-point flag at 3,21 proves it, since its badge sits at row 22, off the bottom of the board and impossible to enclose."
